### 쿠폰 발급 (대고객) - 성공
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/coupons/1/issue
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01

### 내 쿠폰 목록
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/users/me/coupons?page=0&size=20
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01

### 주문 생성 - 쿠폰 미적용
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 3, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 주문 생성 - 쿠폰 적용 (couponId = 발급 쿠폰 ID)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 3, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "couponId": 42
}
